        "official_en": "オルデリオンの清らかな水を守り\r\n街の人々の暮らしを支える……。\r\nそれが私たち、水の守人です。",
        "real_en": "Protecting the pure waters of Olderion and supporting the lives of its people... That’s what we Wardens of Water do."
